1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,140
They pumped that poison down into my chest

2
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:17,380
Felt it burn through my veins, every breath was a test

3
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:24,980
Some nights the only sound was that fan's slow hum

4
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:34,580
And I'd whisper in the dark, "Lord, let tomorrow come"

5
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:40,660
Rang that bell three times, cried like a child

6
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:44,980
Then I learned to walk again... one step, then a mile

7
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:49,940
Shaky on my feet, Lord, weak in the knees

8
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:54,820
Ain't nobody passin' me but the leaves in the breeze

9
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:55,720
And I thought about the faces of the ones I love
